    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d73">

                <pb facs="0163" n="65" xml:id="pg65"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94 Commission/235: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China (Johnson) to the
                            Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peiping</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1932-06-06T18:00:00+08:00">June 6, 1932—6
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received June 6—4:20 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>622. General McCoy and the
                    other members of the League Commission arrived here last night. They expect to
                    remain about 2 weeks before proceeding to Japan.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Johnson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
